Hanumān deems fortress destruction remaining task --- Hanumān vows to feed tail fire with noble houses --- Hanumān roams rooftops loosing worldlike fire --- Wind drives fire through golden jewelled mansions --- Palaces crumble and molten metals flow --- Hanumān stays unsated killing Rākṣasa lords --- Burnt Laṅkā lies curse-struck with slain warriors --- Hanumān quenches tail in ocean and turns to Rāma
